        {"source": "spec", "quote": "Power distribution: DC-DC conversion"}
      ],
      "impact": "The +12V rail would not regulate to the intended voltage; depending on the actual FB reference and divider orientation it could be grossly under-voltage or over-voltage, potentially affecting downstream 12V loads.",
      "confidence": 0.65
    },
